# Local-dev RUNTIME secrets for @baseout/admin. Copy to .dev.vars and fill in.
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit real values. It is also the single
# source of truth for the deployed dev Worker's secrets:
# `pnpm --filter @baseout/admin run deploy` runs `wrangler secret bulk` from
# this file after every deploy. NEVER `wrangler secret put` by hand (CLAUDE.md
# §3.3 — hand-set secrets drift).
#
# DATABASE_URL lives in .env, NOT here (see .env.example) — keeping it out of
# .dev.vars means the bulk sync can never upload it as a Worker secret.

# Shared secret keying the login → admin handoff token (AES-256-GCM). MUST be
# byte-identical to apps/web's ADMIN_HANDOFF_SECRET — web mints the token, admin
# opens it. Generate once and paste into both files:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
ADMIN_HANDOFF_SECRET=

# Backup-engine internal token for staff actions (force backup / run cancel).
# MUST equal apps/web's BACKUP_ENGINE_INTERNAL_TOKEN (== the server's
# INTERNAL_TOKEN) — copy the value from apps/web/.dev.vars. Pairs with the
# BACKUP_ENGINE service binding in wrangler.jsonc.example. Leave empty to run
# without engine access: force-backup 503s, invalidate skips run cancels.
BACKUP_ENGINE_INTERNAL_TOKEN=

# Merged from retired .env.example (2026-08-31)
DATABASE_URL=
